<title>GREECE: Greek shares sharply down at mid-session.</title>
<headline>Greek shares sharply down at mid-session.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greek shares were sharply down at mid-session with the benchmark general share index losing 2.11 percent, 26.48 points, at 1225.89. Losers were leading gainers 160 to 45.</p>
<p>Brokers said it was a sharp but expected correction after the abrupt runup and saw the market meeting support at around 1,200 points on the benchmark index.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
